<p>    Mirvac Ltd				     4.00 cents</p>
<p>Petaluma Ltd				  21.00 cents</p>
<p>    Placer Dome Inc			    US7.50 cents</p>
<p>Sons of Gwalia				12.50 cents</p>
<p>    South East Telecasters		    35.00 cents</p>
